{"id":"lesson-src-2097d337210e8b","moduleNumber":202,"headword":"apply","title":"Apply","subtitle":"「申請／應用／實施／適用」，有哪些真正接近、幾乎可以互換的說法？","description":"「申請／應用／實施／適用」，有哪些真正接近、幾乎可以互換的說法？","words":[{"order":1,"word":"Submit an application","meaning":"提交申請；提出申請","note":"和 apply 在工作、學校、簽證、資助等語境中非常接近。","example":"You must submit an application before Friday.","exampleZh":"你必須在星期五前提交申請。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"You need to apply before the deadline.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submit an application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submit an application","explanation":"正式提交申請。"},{"letter":"B","text":"make a request","explanation":"不一定是正式申請。"},{"letter":"C","text":"put into practice","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"implement","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"She applied to the university last week.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submitted an application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submitted an application","explanation":"完全符合升學申請語境。"},{"letter":"B","text":"used","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"implemented","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"practised","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"Applicants must apply online.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"submit an application","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"submit an application","explanation":"正式申請流程。"},{"letter":"B","text":"seek a position","explanation":"只限求職且較廣。"},{"letter":"C","text":"make use of","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"put into effect","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":2,"word":"Apply for","meaning":"申請；提出申請","note":"這本身就是 apply 最常見的申請結構。","example":"She applied for a teaching position.","exampleZh":"她申請了一個教師職位。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"She wants to submit an application for the job.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"apply for","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"apply for","explanation":"最自然直接。"},{"letter":"B","text":"implement","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"use","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"c