e","meaning":"利用；使用","note":"較正式或技術性的 use。","example":"The system utilizes machine learning to detect unusual patterns.","exampleZh":"系統利用機器學習偵測異常模式。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"The system applies machine learning to detect patterns.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"utilizes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"utilizes","explanation":"技術語境自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"seeks","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"submits","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"pertains to","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The project applies existing resources more efficiently.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"utilizes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"utilizes","explanation":"資源利用。"},{"letter":"B","text":"implements","explanation":"不如 utilize 精確。"},{"letter":"C","text":"applies for","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"puts forward","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":3,"original":"The software applies available data to improve predictions.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"utilizes","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"utilizes","explanation":"正式技術用法。"},{"letter":"B","text":"submits","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"seeks","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"concerns","explanation":"不合。"}]}]},{"order":8,"word":"Make use of","meaning":"利用；使用","note":"常見固定表達，和 use 很接近。","example":"Students should make use of the available resources.","exampleZh":"學生應充分利用可用資源。","exercises":[{"number":1,"original":"Students should apply the resources available to them.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"make use of","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"make use of","explanation":"固定表達「利用」。"},{"letter":"B","text":"apply for","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"C","text":"put into effect","explanation":"不合。"},{"letter":"D","text":"pertain to","explanation":"不合。"}]},{"number":2,"original":"The team applied existing data to improve the model.","zh":"","upgrade":"","answer":"made use of","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"made use of","explanation":"自然。"},{"letter":"B","text":"su